From 243dfa6df183eafcc092f9812ebcbd9da2d3b98e000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrik Torstensson <patrik.torstensson@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 04 Sep 2026 11:45:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Bugfix] Seed align-mode Mamba state_idx in Mamba blocks (#53798)

Version-locked to VLLM_REF=v0.28.1rc0. Upstream PR #53798
(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/53798) open as of 2026-09-04,
commit 243dfa6 on branch fix-mamba-align-resume-seed. Not in any tag
(v0.28.1rc0, v0.29.0rc1/rc2). Drop when VLLM_REF contains the fix.

Adapted for v0.28.1rc0: rc0's MambaHybridModelState._get_mamba_group_info
takes kv_cache_config and lazily populates _mamba_spec via manual loop
(no get_mamba_groups helper). This backport adds ModelState.set_kv_cache_config
no-op hook, makes GPUModelRunner.initialize_kv_cache bind the config before
any add_request, and refactors MambaHybridModelState to resolve Mamba groups
once at init and seed add_request with MambaSpec.block_size instead of
cache_config.block_size (align table is indexed in Mamba blocks; page
unification can scale it past scheduler block -> wrong column or IMA in
precopy_mamba_align_fused_kernel).

Original tests omitted (test files differ at rc0); runtime fix is identical.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
